{"id": "en_quake_home_p2", "total": 74.95, "segments": [{"text": "Part two. Mark smells leaking natural gas inside his dark living room after the violent earthquake.", "start": 0.0, "end": 5.4}, {"text": "A ruptured gas line can easily ignite from a tiny spark and destroy the entire home.", "start": 5.86, "end": 9.86}, {"text": "One. Cover your mouth with a cloth and immediately evacuate the damaged house on foot.", "start": 9.59, "end": 14.68}, {"text": "Mark quickly covers his face and walks away from the deadly fumes without turning on switches.", "start": 15.26, "end": 18.88}, {"text": "Never flip light switches or light matches, because any electrical spark triggers a massive explosion.", "start": 19.44, "end": 23.58}, {"text": "Two. Expect powerful aftershocks to shake the damaged structure again within minutes or hours.", "start": 23.110000000000003, "end": 28.4}, {"text": "Mark moves carefully toward the front exit, keeping his head covered against loose falling debris.", "start": 28.4, "end": 32.62}, {"text": "He avoids touching shattered window glass and cracked walls while exiting into the cool night air.", "start": 33.06, "end": 36.6}, {"text": "Three. Move to a clear open area outside, far away from tall trees and buildings.", "start": 36.657, "end": 41.22}, {"text": "Mark reaches the open street outside and stays clear of dangling overhead power lines nearby.", "start": 41.9, "end": 45.48}, {"text": "A sharp aftershock suddenly jolts the neighborhood, but Mark remains completely safe in the open.", "start": 45.98, "end": 49.94}, {"text": "Never reenter a damaged house until official emergency crews inspect the gas lines for safety.", "start": 50.46, "end": 54.68}, {"text": "Mark uses his mobile phone to call emergency services from a safe distance outside.", "start": 55.24, "end": 58.74}, {"text": "First responders arrive quickly at the scene to turn off the main gas line completely.", "start": 59.28, "end": 62.36}, {"text": "His fast decisions and calm actions saved his life during 2 lethal earthquake hazards tonight.", "start": 63.0, "end": 66.82}, {"text": "Check for gas leaks and evacuate immediately after severe shaking stops. Follow for a new scenario tomorrow.", "start": 67.3, "end": 71.8}], "words": [["Part", 0.0, 0.24], ["two.", 0.24, 0.481], ["Mark", 1.2, 1.48], ["smells", 1.48, 1.7], ["leaking", 1.7, 2.14], ["natural", 2.14, 2.52], ["gas", 2.52, 2.88], ["inside", 2.88, 3.4], ["his", 3.4, 3.64], ["dark", 3.64, 3.78], ["living", 3.78, 4.06], ["room", 4.06, 4.28], ["after", 4.28, 4.66], ["the", 4.66, 4.78], ["violent", 4.78, 5.02], ["earthquake.", 5.02, 5.4], ["A", 5.86, 6.08], ["ruptured", 6.08, 6.42], ["gas", 6.42, 6.6], ["line", 6.6, 6.84], ["can", 6.84, 7.02], ["easily", 7.02, 7.48], ["ignite", 7.48, 7.72], ["from", 7.72, 7.94], ["a", 7.94, 8.06], ["tiny", 8.06, 8.32], ["spark", 8.32, 8.6], ["and", 8.6, 8.8], ["destroy", 8.8, 9.08], ["the", 9.08, 9.24], ["entire", 9.24, 9.58], ["home.", 9.58, 9.86], ["One.", 9.59, 9.125], ["Cover", 11.22, 11.36], ["your", 11.36, 11.52], ["mouth", 11.52, 11.7], ["with", 11.7, 11.92], ["a", 11.92, 12.02], ["cloth", 12.02, 12.2], ["and", 12.2, 12.42], ["immediately", 12.42, 12.8], ["evacuate", 12.8, 13.34], ["the", 13.34, 13.5], ["damaged", 13.5, 13.74], ["house", 13.74, 14.0], ["on", 14.0, 14.4], ["foot.", 14.4, 14.68], ["Mark", 15.26, 15.38], ["quickly", 15.38, 15.72], ["covers", 15.72, 15.94], ["his", 15.94, 16.08], ["face", 16.08, 16.24], ["and", 16.24, 16.58], ["walks", 16.58, 16.74], ["away", 16.74, 17.02], ["from", 17.02, 17.22], ["the", 17.22, 17.34], ["deadly", 17.34, 17.5], ["fumes", 17.5, 17.78], ["without", 17.78, 18.08], ["turning", 18.08, 18.46], ["on", 18.46, 18.58], ["switches.", 18.58, 18.88], ["Never", 19.44, 19.76], ["flip", 19.76, 19.98], ["light", 19.98, 20.16], ["switches", 20.16, 20.44], ["or", 20.44, 20.72], ["light", 20.72, 20.92], ["matches,", 20.92, 21.2], ["because", 21.2, 21.44], ["any", 21.44, 21.68], ["electrical", 21.68, 22.02], ["spark", 